Grammar

    0 $accept: file $end

    1 file: file param
    2     | ε

    3 param: VALUE EQUAL QUOTE VALUE QUOTE


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    VALUE <vstring> (258) 3
    EQUAL (259) 3
    QUOTE (260) 3


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (6)
        on left: 0
    file <varray> (7)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0 1
    param <varray> (8)
        on left: 3
        on right: 1


State 0

    0 $accept: • file $end

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (file)

    file  go to state 1


State 1

    0 $accept: file • $end
    1 file: file • param

    $end   shift, and go to state 2
    VALUE  shift, and go to state 3

    param  go to state 4


State 2

    0 $accept: file $end •

    $default  accept


State 3

    3 param: VALUE • EQUAL QUOTE VALUE QUOTE

    EQUAL  shift, and go to state 5


State 4

    1 file: file param •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (file)


State 5

    3 param: VALUE EQUAL • QUOTE VALUE QUOTE

    QUOTE  shift, and go to state 6


State 6

    3 param: VALUE EQUAL QUOTE • VALUE QUOTE

    VALUE  shift, and go to state 7


State 7

    3 param: VALUE EQUAL QUOTE VALUE • QUOTE

    QUOTE  shift, and go to state 8


State 8

    3 param: VALUE EQUAL QUOTE VALUE QUOTE •

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (param)
